# 38. FRONTEND ARCHITECTURE

The frontend should not contain domain truth.

It should render domain state.

Conceptually:

```text
UI
 ↓
Application State
 ↓
Domain State
 ↓
API / Event Layer
```

The frontend should therefore avoid:

- duplicated business logic
- arbitrary page-local state
- hard-coded threat conclusions
- fake system status presented as real
- independent versions of the same event
- hidden state transitions

