# 50. LEAST PRIVILEGE

A user should receive only the information and action authority required for their role.

This matters especially when AEGIS integrates:

- patient information
- laboratory information
- environmental information
- organizational information
- security-sensitive information

The architecture must therefore support data minimization and access boundaries.

