# 73. SYSTEM OF RECORD

For each domain entity, AEGIS must eventually define a single authoritative source.

Example:

```text
Event
→ Event Service / authoritative store

Assessment
→ Assessment state

Response
→ Response state

Observation
→ Observation store

Audit
→ Immutable audit record
```

The UI is not the system of record.

