# 74. PERFORMANCE ARCHITECTURE

AEGIS should prioritize:

1. Time to meaningful information
2. Perceived responsiveness
3. Stable interaction
4. Data freshness visibility
5. Progressive loading
6. Graceful degradation

Heavy visualizations should not block critical information.

